<title>SRI LANKA: Weather-Evening showers seen over Sri Lanka.</title>
<headline>Weather-Evening showers seen over Sri Lanka.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's metereological department released the following rainfall figures for 24 hours ending Tuesday morning</p>
<p>Hydro catchment areas (in mm):</p>
<p>    Canyon		    5.8</p>
<p>    Castlereigh	     8.0</p>
<p>    Kotmale		   0</p>
<p>    Laxapana		 12.0</p>
<p>    Moussakele		0</p>
<p>    Norton		   14.5</p>
<p>    Randenigala	     0.2</p>
<p>    Victoria		  2.0</p>
<p>    Samanalawewa	    0</p>
<p>    Ukuwela		   1.1</p>
<p>    Rantembe		  0</p>
<p>The department forecasts afternoon or evening thundershowers over several places of the island on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
